        "original_id": "8e612e21-57f6-5724-958a-0256a11e340d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: The Palazzo, Venetian Resort and Casino, Sands Convention Center, Sands Expo, original Sands Hotel\n- Companies: Las Vegas Sands Corporation\n- Topics: hotel complexes, convention centers, ownership and operations\n\nFacts:\n- Sands Expo opened in 1990 across the street from the original Sands Hotel.\n- Sands Expo was the second largest convention center in the world when it opened.\n- The Palazzo hotel and casino are part of a larger complex that also includes the adjoining Venetian Resort and Casino and the Sands Convention Center.\n- The larger complex containing The Palazzo is operated as one hotel.\n- Las Vegas Sands Corporation owns and operates The Palazzo complex, including the Venetian Resort and Casino and the Sands Convention Center.",
